#\#CIF_1.1
#
# CIF 1.1 quoted character strings (spec para. 15): a closing
# quote is only a closer when it is followed by a blank, a line
# terminator, or end of input; a quote followed by a non-blank
# character is content. A loop line may hold several values of
# different forms.
data_cif1_quoted_values

_sq 'don't rock the boat'
_dq "What's this ab\"out?"
_embedded 'a dog''s life'
_empty_single ''
_empty_double ""
_trailing_space 'C19 H19 N O3' 

loop_
_atom_type_symbol
_atom_type_description
